"""
core/qa_engine.py  –  Trilingual Offline Paddy Disease Q&A Engine for AgriVision.

Features:
  • Knowledge base per disease loaded from app/data/qa_knowledge.json
  • Scoped to detected disease class (blast, blb, brown_spot, healthy, other)
  • Trilingual detection & response:
      - Tamil script (தமிழ்)  -> responds in pure Tamil (answer_ta)
      - Tanglish (Romanized) -> responds in natural Tanglish (answer_tanglish)
      - English             -> responds in clear English (answer_en)
  • High-precision intent matching (Treatment/Spray, Dosage, Prevention, Spread,
    Weather, Fertilizer, Symptoms, Cause, Variety, Harvest, Severity, Definition)
  • Dynamic injection of live scan metrics in matching language
  • Multi-turn conversation context for follow-up questions
  • Unanswered question logging to SQLite history_db
  • Offline-first (no cloud APIs required)
"""

